repoAccessFix.en:
The repository is not readable right now (the tools report that they cannot reach it). Ordering rule: if the repo does not exist yet, run "Create & publish" to create and push it, then re-check; investigate in order:
1. Existence: when this directory has no remote repo yet, click "Create & publish" (the two-step wizard creates the repo and pushes it);
2. Login and permissions: check the status of the "Signed in to GitHub" row; a private repo needs access for the signed-in account (no access and "not found" can both come back as 404);
3. Network and proxy: check the network row in the environment check and follow what it says.
After fixing, ask the user to re-check.

glabInstallFix.en:
Install the GitLab CLI (glab) for DSH:
1. Check first: glab --version;
2. If missing, install per OS: Windows → winget install --id GitLab.gitlab-cli (or scoop install glab); macOS → brew install glab; Linux → follow gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli official install;
3. After install, ask the user to re-check.
